        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw6kriko-07tpysfe7r",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Codex"
      },
      "text": "One possible activity on days 4–10 is a landing on Detaille Island at the abandoned British research station. High mountains and glaciers surround the island. The expedition team chooses the day and the approach to shore based on weather and ice conditions."
    },
