      "text": "The Antarctic leg concludes"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:d1bf136a4a3c936a",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "e605ff8461a44587881d177cb2ef52c616e9fe92646028b64d534994163954fd",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw6kriko-07tpysfe7r",
        "model": "GPT-6.1 Codex"
      },
      "text": "This marks the end of the programme for days 4–10. Possible stops on the way north include the Fish Islands, with Adélie penguins and Antarctic shags, and the Melchior Islands, with icebergs, leopard seals, fur seals and whales. Diving around the Melchior Islands requires separate confirmation. Sea conditions determine exactly when the ship enters the Drake Passage."
